# Skill And Capability Installation

Use `docs/SKILLS.md` for project-specific skill routing.

## Policy

- Required capabilities block or degrade the matching workflow when missing.
- Recommended capabilities warn but do not block unrelated work.
- Task-required capabilities block only the matching task branch.
- Do not install broad MCP/plugin sets just because they are popular.
- Do not edit global Codex files without explicit approval and backup.
- Do not paste the full live skill catalog into project docs.

## Global Write Gate

Real `~/.codex` writes require explicit user approval and evidence.
